  message: "2026-10-10 docstring audit (verifier repro): beyond the scope PATH prefix, the same router fixture shows `resources` emits 7 routes with no PUT, ignores only:/except:, and leaves the controller unqualified by the scope alias (UserController, not AppWeb.UserController). Filed separately as the resources item; fixing both together is natural."  # 00ea
